Carry the raw dial-failure evidence (DIALSTATUS + Q.850 cause) in the
coordinator's ai_result callback, so an operator can read WHY an outbound AI
dial failed from the CRM call card instead of capturing trunk traffic.

Applies to /usr/local/lib/fanum-voice/fanum_pbx_coordinator.py on the PBX.

  before: 9ac291ac5152940e302d1cb1060b0dc3c5ab0c1b4a69125c4a6c69dba4e8a1f6
  after:  2edfb84f12487fcd0a1b7d23c161ec829ea431b164be756b208fbddc05516a15

