DEPLOY ORDER: the CRM side (optional dialStatus/hangupCause in the strict
call-result contract, migration 20260826120000_call_dial_failure_diagnostics)
must be live in production BEFORE this coordinator build sends its first
callback — voiceAgentCallResultSchema is .strict(), so an old CRM would 400
every non-connected ai_result.

Why this is safe against the outbox conflict fence: outbox rows are inserted
once per deterministic event_id, and duplicate terminal evidence returns early
(state == 'terminal' comparison) before _insert_outbox, so a row enqueued by
the old build is never re-hashed against the new payload shape. The gate-abort
ai_result is deliberately unchanged: a gate abort has no dial evidence.

Verified offline against a temp sqlite state store (no calls placed): failed
terminal enqueues {..., "dialStatus": "CHANUNAVAIL", "hangupCause": "1"};
cause-only evidence omits dialStatus instead of sending ""; duplicate
redelivery leaves the outbox row untouched; connected terminals still enqueue
nothing.

--- fanum_pbx_coordinator.py (live 9ac291ac)
+++ fanum_pbx_coordinator.py (candidate 2edfb84f)
@@ -1357,6 +1357,17 @@
                         "providerOutcome": outcome,
                         "turns": [],
                     }
+                    # The raw evidence behind the collapsed outcome, so the CRM
+                    # can show WHY the dial failed (e.g. CHANUNAVAIL / Q.850 1)
+                    # without a trunk capture. Empty values are omitted, not
+                    # sent as "": the CRM contract accepts only non-empty
+                    # tokens, and gate aborts have no dial evidence at all.
+                    dial_status = str(canonical.get("dialStatus") or "")
+                    if dial_status:
+                        payload["dialStatus"] = dial_status
+                    hangup_cause = str(canonical.get("hangupCause") or "")
+                    if hangup_cause:
+                        payload["hangupCause"] = hangup_cause
                     route = "ai_result"
                 else:
                     payload = None
